network-manager-gpclient (1.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add HIP (Host Integrity Protection) checkbox to VPN configuration dialogs
  * HIP enabled by default, adds --hip flag to gpclient command
  * Support for Plasma, GTK4 (GNOME Settings), and GTK3 (nm-connection-editor)
  * Update README with Ubuntu 22.04 pip3 install sdbus instruction

